comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-30T11:28:35.807Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check searched all statuses for local install self-nesting and destination containment; related historical guards do not own this standard-layout recursion. GitHub report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/827"
  "2026-07-30T22:32:04.174Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: repeated nested-source install staging excludes destination, .agents, node_modules, and backups; focused package suite and full 6584-test coverage passed at 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-07-30T22:51:29.330Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: all six linked test commands passed through pm test with sandbox isolation; pnpm release:gates passed static quality, docs, SDK surface/parity, token and context evaluation, 6,584 tests at 100/100/100/100, secrets scan, packed npx smoke, and 88-command package-first dogfood. The only remaining gate is hosted analysis for the exact commit, which is unavailable until this branch is pushed. Fresh unrelated-workspace acceptance also proved strict duplicate refusal is atomic, explicit bypass and copy succeed, and core-field recovery performs no write."
  "2026-07-30T23:28:51.120Z","harness:codex","Final native-layout revalidation: the focused diff is 952 insertions and 97 deletions with no formatter churn; 406 files and 6,583 tests pass at 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. Typecheck, ESLint, static quality, package boundary/parity, token budgets, SDK surface/import-cost/transport gates, docs, latest pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1 check mode, tracker health/history integrity, and fresh unrelated-workspace acceptance all pass."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-30T22:51:30.413Z","harness:codex","Local install staging must filter tracker roots, dependency trees, backups, and the resolved destination during traversal because destination containment can otherwise recurse on repeated installs."
